", "style": "BodyText", "text": "D: calcium chloride (IV) 500-1000mg over 5- 10 minutes, repeat as needed", "runs": [{"text": "D: ", "bold": true}, {"text": "calcium chloride (IV) 500-1000mg over 5- 10 minutes, repeat as needed"}]}], "source": {"file": "medical.docx", "chapter": "Approach to patients with emergency conditions", "start": "body-01524", "end": "body-01556"}}